<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body>
    <table style="width: 100%; float: left; border: 5px solid #0000000d; padding: 0px 10px;" border="0">

      <tr>
        <td>
          <img src="{{SERVER_DOMAIN_NAME_HEADER}}" style="width: 100%;" />
        </td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td>

          <p>Dear {{name}},</p>

          <p>
            We are glad to have extended to you a loan for Rs <strong>{{disbursalAmount}}</strong>
            on <strong>{{disbursalDate}}</strong>. And I am the one who had sanctioned your loan.
          </p>

          <p>
            Your repayment date is <strong>{{repayDate}}</strong> and you are liable to pay Rs.
            <strong>{{repayAmount}}</strong> (along with interest) on that date.
          </p>

          <p>
            Our endeavour is always to build a sustainable relationship with our customers so both sides
            can stand to benefit from this association. You can help build this relationship by paying
            back on time and on our side, we will always stand by you whenever you need urgent support.
          </p>

          <p>
            We also support your efforts to repay on time by offering various types of incentives to
            lessen your burden. Early payment and on-time payment are both amply rewarded.
          </p>

          <p>
            We understand that often non-payment happens due to forgetfulness or oversight. We will,
            therefore, send you timely reminders so your payments are always on time.
          </p>

          <p>Your loan no. is <strong>{{loanNo}}</strong></p>

          <p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>

          <p>
            You may make payment by visiting this link:
            <a href="{{paymentLink}}" target="_blank" alt="Click To Pay">Click To Pay</a>
          </p>

          <p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>

          <p>Best regards,</p>
          <p>Team {{company_name_show}}</p>

        </td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td>
          <img src="{{SERVER_DOMAIN_NAME_FOOTER}}" style="width: 100%;" />
        </td>
      </tr>

    </table>
  </body>
</html>
